{#
AGENT EXECUTION FLOW:

1. Load context: services, dates, customer_email
2. Show smart greeting with menu (if first turn)
3. Receive user query
4. Detect intent automatically (create/cancel/reschedule/info)
5. Route to appropriate workflow based on intent
6. Call necessary tools in order specified
7. Validate responses against rules
8. Format output with UX best practices
9. Provide next steps or fallback options

CRITICAL RULES:
- Tool calls ONLY after reading user input
- Intent detection BEFORE tool selection
- No hallucinations (use tool data or nothing)
- Always confirm destructive operations
- No hardcoding (all from context or tools)
- Flexible date parsing with explicit examples
-#}

